# Dashboard

## Overview
The dashboard is the main window of the application.
It will contain the following Sections on the page:
    - topbar (frozen): 
      - left: Live Inputs
      - right: Live Outputs
    - content (scrollable vertically):
      - row 1 : 
        - left: camera stream 1 - with annotation of the detection result
        - right: professionaly formatted detection results for the camera stream 1
      - row 2 : 
        - left: camera stream 2 - with annotation of the detection result
        - right: professionaly formatted detection results for the camera stream 2
      

## Design Considerations
- The dashboard will be designed to be responsive and to work on all screen sizes.
- Professional minimal rounded corners will be used for the UI.
- smooth animations
- professional colors
- professional fonts
- professional icons
- professional layout and spacing.
- colors - light theme with grayish navy blue Accent. (keep it adjustable)
